Package: mcsimr
Title: Local Monte Carlo Simulation Workbench
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("M.", "H.", email = "maintainer@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Author: M. H.
Maintainer: M. H. <maintainer@example.com>
Description: A local-first R package and Shiny app foundation for designing,
    running, checkpointing, summarizing, and exporting reproducible Monte Carlo
    simulation studies. The initial engine targets ordinary least squares
    regression, with the architecture intended to expand to SEM simulations
    through lavaan.
